phase P1
title History
description
    **Goal:** none; nothing here is work to do. These are the Tasks finished or retired before the Epic was rewritten
    on 2026-11-15, kept as one line each because the Specs cite them as where a ruling was made. Their full text is in
    `wiki/tasks/V3/` at commit `6b9fe478`.

    Stage A is done: the design and the prototype were reconciled, the Plans merged and the core Specs written. The
    Pay path runs on production. Every Task marked "the conformance suite" was about the old private test system,
    deleted on 2026-11-15 (last copy at commit `52a883e6`).
